WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.888 --> 00:00:07.290
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:12.620 --> 00:00:13.120
We're in.

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.320
The show is about a family that's refusing to mourn.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:22.300
They'll keep telling themselves stories.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.190
They'll believe anything that they hear.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.560
But the presence of Leanne in their lives

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:29.440
keeps them from having that conversation.

00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:30.580
Congratulations.

00:00:30.580 --> 00:00:33.010
We're officially in the carb delivery business.

00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:36.670
Episode three was this very fun premise

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:39.250
that they're hunting Leanne.

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:40.410
Now what?

00:00:40.410 --> 00:00:41.235
Nothing.

00:00:41.235 --> 00:00:43.470
We wait.

00:00:43.470 --> 00:00:47.010
I encouraged the writers and the directors to go to big places

00:00:47.010 --> 00:00:49.250
and let me only see it through this box.

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.430
[DOORBELL]

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:52.860
The devices are the way you see the world.

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:56.460
I love that feeling of constriction.

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:57.210
Leanne?

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.070
You can finish the painting with your mind.

00:01:01.920 --> 00:01:06.675
I use the house to talk about a larger tapestry,

00:01:06.675 --> 00:01:09.930
and I think the basement and the hole in the basement

00:01:09.930 --> 00:01:12.420
are the draw to the darker things, things

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.350
that bring us down.

00:01:16.660 --> 00:01:19.240
There's a moment where Julian drops his wine bottle in there

00:01:19.240 --> 00:01:21.190
and has to reach in and pull it out,

00:01:21.190 --> 00:01:26.270
and it represents a lot of our vices, our darker instincts.

00:01:26.270 --> 00:01:27.380
What's wrong?

00:01:27.380 --> 00:01:28.880
What have you done?

00:01:28.880 --> 00:01:29.854
Leanne.

00:01:29.854 --> 00:01:31.090
Leanne.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:31.930
Leanne!

00:01:31.930 --> 00:01:34.540
What is really fun to play this season

00:01:34.540 --> 00:01:37.150
is to what lengths will Dorothy go.

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:39.130
And I think she'll do anything.

00:01:39.130 --> 00:01:43.640
I mean, she'll cross any line to get this child back.

00:01:43.640 --> 00:01:45.350
This is what I want you to do--

00:01:45.350 --> 00:01:47.570
pick her up off the floor, put her

00:01:47.570 --> 00:01:51.730
in the backseat of your car, and drive her here.

